# Phase 2: DQ Generator Capital Questions

## Overview

Replace labor-thinking decision questions (FIRST_500, TIME_TO_CASH, SKILL_MATCH) with capital-deployment questions (DEPLOY_BUDGET, RISK_CAPITAL, ASSET_SCAN, ROI_TARGET). The DQ generator drives Wave 1 agent prompts — changing questions changes what agents SEARCH for.

## Requirements

- Functional: New TIER_0 question codes: DEPLOY_BUDGET, RISK_CAPITAL, ASSET_SCAN, ROI_TARGET, KILL_CRITERIA (reuse existing code)
- Functional: Remove or deprecate: FIRST_500, TIME_TO_CASH (pure labor questions)
- Functional: Keep: SKILL_MATCH (useful for asset-building), NETWORK_ENTRY (useful for deal flow), RISK_CAP→rename to RISK_CAPITAL
- Functional: Keep sophisticated questions: P90_MECHANISM, ARBITRAGE_WINDOW, COMPOUND_ASSET, STAIR_STEP_PATH, SURVIVORSHIP_DELTA, BRIDGE_CAPITAL
- Non-functional: LEVERAGE question stays in ALL tiers (already shipped)

## Architecture

New questions replace old:

```python
# OLD: labor questions
"FIRST_500": "How to earn first $500 from this ecosystem?"
"TIME_TO_CASH": "Days from today to first payment?"

# NEW: capital questions
"DEPLOY_BUDGET": {
    "question": "How much can you LOSE without affecting life? (= deployment budget)",
    "question_vi": "Bao nhiêu tiền bạn có thể MẤT mà không ảnh hưởng cuộc sống? (= ngân sách triển khai)",
    "kill_signal": "$0 = no deployment possible, pivot to pure-build assets only",
    "tiers": ["TIER_0", "TIER_1"],
},
"RISK_CAPITAL": {
    "question": "What % of capital are you willing to lose in 30 days on failed assets?",
    "question_vi": "Bạn sẵn sàng mất bao nhiêu % vốn trong 30 ngày cho asset thất bại?",
    "kill_signal": "0% = no risk tolerance, cannot deploy micro-assets",
    "tiers": ["TIER_0", "TIER_1"],
},
"ASSET_SCAN": {
    "question": "What micro-assets (<$200) can generate revenue WITHOUT you after setup?",
    "question_vi": "Micro-asset nào (<$200) có thể tạo revenue MÀ KHÔNG CẦN BẠN sau setup?",
    "kill_signal": "0 assets identified = sleep test impossible at this capital level",
    "tiers": ["TIER_0"],
},
"ROI_TARGET": {
    "question": "Target ROI: $X deployed → $Y/mo passive. What's your Y/X ratio target?",
    "question_vi": "Target ROI: triển khai $X → $Y/tháng passive. Tỷ lệ Y/X mục tiêu?",
    "kill_signal": "Expects >100% monthly ROI = delusional, needs calibration",
    "tiers": ["TIER_0", "TIER_1", "TIER_2"],
},
"ASSET_TYPE": {
    "question": "Build (code/content) or Buy (domain/template/tool) or Both?",
    "question_vi": "Build (code/content) hay Buy (domain/template/tool) hay Both?",
    "kill_signal": "Neither — no deployment path",
    "tiers": ["TIER_0", "TIER_1"],
},
"BUILD_VS_BUY": {
    "question": "For $500: build 1 custom asset OR buy 3-5 existing micro-assets?",
    "question_vi": "Với $500: build 1 custom asset HOẶC mua 3-5 micro-asset có sẵn?",
    "kill_signal": "Neither viable at this budget",
    "tiers": ["TIER_0", "TIER_1"],
},
"COMPOUND_MECHANISM": {
    "question": "How does profit from Asset A fund/improve Asset B?",
    "question_vi": "Profit từ Asset A fund/improve Asset B thế nào?",
    "kill_signal": "No cross-asset compound — portfolio is just a list",
    "tiers": ["TIER_0", "TIER_1", "TIER_2"],
},
```

Update `TIER_QUESTION_CODES`:

```python
"TIER_0": [
    # Capital deployment questions (NEW)
    "DEPLOY_BUDGET", "RISK_CAPITAL", "ASSET_SCAN", "ROI_TARGET",
    # Keep sophisticated questions
    "P90_MECHANISM", "ARBITRAGE_WINDOW", "COMPOUND_ASSET",
    "STAIR_STEP_PATH", "SURVIVORSHIP_DELTA", "BRIDGE_CAPITAL",
    # Keep universal
    "LEVERAGE", "KILL_CRITERIA",
],
```

